  "html": "<p>Weapons are wielded damage-inflicting <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">items</a> of which, there are two main types- Melee Weapons and Ranged Weapons. While there aren't too many types of ranged weapons, there are several sub-types of melee weapons.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Weapon_List\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Weapon List </span></h2>\n<p><b>Fighter</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-fighter\">One-Handed</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-fighter\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><b>Mage</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-mage\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-mage\">One-Handed</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-mage\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-mage\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><b>Ranger</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-ranger\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-ranger\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"RAINBOW_only_weapon_list\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> RAINBOW only weapon list </span></h2>\n<p><b>Fighter</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-Fighter-Rainbows\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-Fighter-Rainbows\">One-Handed</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-Fighter-Rainbows\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-Fighter-Rainbows\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><b>Mage</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-Mage-Rainbows\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-Mage-Rainbows\">One-Handed</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-Mage-Rainbows\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-Mage-Rainbows\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><b>Ranger</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-Ranger-Rainbows\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-Ranger-Rainbows\">Two-Handed</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
